  BOINC Moo! Wrapper control file (Linux x86_64).  The wrapper reads this to
  learn which task to execute and how.  It launches the Hyunjin dnetc client
  (with the Hyunjin CUDA-C core) in offline mode against the per-WU buffered
  work files.

  For use in distributed.net projects only.
